  - m_Id: 46847000000000300
    m_Localized: "Before every [[0]] attacks, spend up to [[1]] available {barrier|Barriers}. Grant '[[2]]' to that attack per Barrier spent, as one modifier with its value multiplied by the number spent. Counts completed attacks, including misses. Spent Barriers and the bonus are lost on a miss. Spending triggers Barrier loss reactions."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46847000000000301
    m_Localized: Requires an attack modifier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46849000000000001
    m_Localized: 'Start combat in Offence: [[0]]% increased Damage. After [[1]] completed attacks, including misses, switch to Defence: [[2]]% increased Armor and Evasion instead. After [[3]] incoming attacks that are not evaded, return to Offence. Blocked and fully absorbed attacks count.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46850000000000001
    m_Localized: '[[0]]% of attack damage that would remove Health after defences becomes a debt, paid evenly over [[1]] seconds. Each hit has its own deadline. Damage over Time and mystic absorption are not deferred. Debt payments bypass defences and cannot create new debt.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46851000000000001
    m_Localized: 'Killing an enemy restores 1 {barrier|Barrier}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46852000000000001
    m_Localized: 'Bleed on you restores Health instead of dealing Damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46853000000000001
    m_Localized: 'Each restored {barrier|Barrier} grants 1 stack of {fortification|Fortification}.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46854000000000001
    m_Localized: 'The two lowest-damage elements in each attack fully penetrate their Resistances.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 46855000000000001
